   "kind": "Simulation",
   "sub": "The Hodgkin–Huxley model: find the threshold and the refractory period, and block sodium channels with tetrodotoxin or potassium channels with TEA (the way local anaesthetics block nerve conduction).",
   "note": "SciGradify Biology's simulation: the published 1952 equations for one patch of squid axon membrane, with no propagation or myelin. The ionic mechanism is the same in mammalian nerve.",
   "tasks": null,
   "lessons": [
